  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "トップを　めざすはずが　ゆきやまに\nまよいのぼり　さむさに　たえるうちに\nけが　はえてきて　しんかしていた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "톱을 노리려다 설산에서\n헤매게 되고 추위를 견디던 중에\n털이 생겨서 진화했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "原本是為了超越顛峰而深入山中修行，\n卻走錯路登上雪山，在忍受寒冷的同時，\n毛髮不斷生長而產生了進化。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il rêvait d’atteindre le sommet d’un pic enneigé,\nmais s’est égaré en chemin. Il a dû évoluer pour\nsurvivre au froid et a acquis un pelage fourni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wollte auf eine verschneite Bergspitze,\nhat sich aber verlaufen. In der Kälte wuchs\nihm dann ein Fell und es entwickelte sich weiter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tras perderse intentando coronar una alta\nmontaña, desarrolló una capa de pelo para\nprotegerse del frío.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dopo essersi smarrito su una montagna innevata\nche voleva scalare a ogni costo, si è evoluto\nsviluppando del pelo per proteggersi dal freddo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It aimed for the top but got lost and ended up\non a snowy mountain. Being forced to endure\nthe cold, this Pokémon evolved and grew fur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "トップを　目指すはずが　雪山に\n迷い登り　寒さに　耐えるうちに\n毛が　生えてきて　進化していた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "应该是以登顶为目标的，却阴差阳错地\n登上了雪山，在忍耐寒冷的过程中，\n由于毛发不断生长而进化成这样。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tras perderse intentando coronar una alta\nmontaña, desarrolló una capa de pelo para\nprotegerse del frío.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とにかく　みさかいなく　なぐる。\nいざと　なったら　ハサミを　じせつし\nロケットのように　はっしゃし　なぐる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "아무튼 무작정 때린다.\n여차하면 집게를 스스로 끊어\n로켓처럼 발사해서 때린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不顧一切地打架。\n遇到突發危機便會自斷鉗子，\n像發射火箭一樣砸出去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il distribue les coups de pince au petit bonheur\nla chance. En dernier recours, il les décroche et\nles envoie telles des roquettes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Schlägt erst einmal wahllos zu. Kommt es\nhart auf hart, stößt es seine Scheren ab\nund verschießt sie wie Raketen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Asesta golpes con las pinzas a diestro y\nsiniestro. Si se ve en apuros, se desprende de\nellas lanzándolas como si fueran cohetes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sferra colpi alla cieca. Come ultima risorsa,\nsi stacca le chele e le spara come razzi per\ncolpire l’avversario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It just throws punches indiscriminately. In times\nof desperation, it can lop off its own pincers\nand fire them like rockets.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とにかく　見境なく　なぐる。\nいざと　なったら　ハサミを　自切し\nロケットのように　発射し　なぐる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不管不顾地打架。\n遇到危机时刻，就会自断钳子，\n像发射火箭一样砸出去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Asesta golpes con las pinzas a diestro y\nsiniestro. Si se ve en apuros, se desprende de\nellas lanzándolas como si fueran cohetes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ハサミの　なかに　れいきを　ためて\nぶんなぐる。　ぶあつい　こおりの\nかべも　こなごなに　してしまうぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "집게 안에 냉기를 모아\n때려눕힌다. 두꺼운 얼음벽도\n가루로 만들어 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會將寒氣聚集在鉗子中\n然後用力痛毆。就算是\n厚厚的冰壁也能打得粉碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il concentre le froid dans ses pinces avant de\nfrapper. Ses coups sont suffisamment puissants\npour réduire un épais mur de glace en morceaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es speichert kalte Luft in seinen Scheren. Wenn\nes mit diesen um sich schlägt, kann es selbst\ndicke Eiswände zerbröckeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En el interior de las pinzas acumula aire gélido.\nLos golpes que asesta son capaces de hacer\nañicos incluso gruesas paredes de hielo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Accumula aria fredda all’interno delle chele\nper poi picchiare duro. Riesce a sbriciolare\nanche spessi muri di ghiaccio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its\nfoes. It can even smash thick walls of ice\nto bits!",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ハサミの　中に　冷気を　溜めて\nぶん殴る。　分厚い　氷の\n壁も　粉々に　してしまうぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在钳子中积蓄冷气，然后猛殴。\n即使是很厚的冰壁也能打得粉碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En el interior de las pinzas acumula aire gélido.\nLos golpes que asesta son capaces de hacer\nañicos incluso gruesas paredes de hielo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かんがえるより　まず　なぐってみる。\nゆきなだれを　パンチの　ラッシュで\nおしかえしたという　きろくも　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "생각하기보다는 일단 때리고 본다.\n눈사태를 펀치 러시로\n되받아쳤다는 기록도 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "習慣不經過大腦先動手打了再說。\n以前曾有過用連續不斷的拳擊\n把雪崩推回去的紀錄。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Agir ou réfléchir ? Crabominable choisit de\nfrapper ! On raconte qu’il serait déjà parvenu\nà repousser une avalanche à coups de pince.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es denkt nicht lange nach und schlägt einfach\nzu. Laut manchen Berichten kann es mit seinen\nschnellen Schlägen selbst Lawinen stoppen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No se lo piensa dos veces a la hora de zurrar.\nSe tiene constancia de que sus puñetazos\nfrenéticos han llegado a detener aludes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attacca subito, senza pensarci due volte.\nSecondo alcune testimonianze, ha fermato\nuna valanga con una raffica di pugni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Before it stops to think, it just starts pummeling.\nThere are records of its turning back\navalanches with a flurry of punches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "考えるより　まず　殴ってみる。\nゆきなだれを　パンチの　ラッシュで\n押し返したという　記録も　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
